## Frontend runtime API URL (Vercel production should point to Render backend)
VITE_BACKEND_URL=https://your-render-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=https://your-render-backend.onrender.com/api/v1

## Dev-only Vite proxy target (used when VITE_BACKEND_URL hhhh is not set)
VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8080

